# The onap-ui-* libraries are developed in Gerrit (sdc/onap-ui-common, sdc/onap-ui-angular,
# sdc/onap-ui-react) and released only to ONAP Nexus. npmjs.org still serves the older GitHub-era
# builds and has not been published to since 2022, so the two registries disagree about which
# versions exist. Jenkins defaulted to Nexus while developer machines and GitHub Actions defaulted
# to npmjs.org, which is how SDC-4904 went red in CI while every local build stayed green. Pinning
# the group makes them agree; it proxies npmjs.org, so the rest of the dependency tree still
# resolves.
#
# For the same reason the onap-ui-* versions in package.json are exact rather than ranges:
# package-lock.json is gitignored, so a range is re-resolved on every build and any new upstream
# release silently changes what ships. (Noted here rather than beside the dependency because
# package.json cannot carry comments.)
registry=https://nexus3.onap.org/repository/npm.public/
